      "content": "2.6 Mineral Resources"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "wybevo0",
      "content": "Madhya Pradesh is one of the most mineral-rich states in India. It is particularly known for diamond, coal, iron ore, copper, limestone, dolomite, bauxite, and various industrial minerals."
